# Sees Money (shop/), Item (catalog/'s front file) and Date (the standard library).
Order_Line {}
  item {Item}
  price {Decimal} value: item.price, places: 2
  text {Text}
    1. {item}
    2. {Newline}

Order {}
  on {Date}
  items {Order_Line} qty: 1..
  total {Decimal} sum: items.price, places: 2
  text {Text}
    1. {on}
    2. {Newline}
    3. {items}
